OpenCode (https://github.com/sst/opencode)
Copyright (c) 2025 opencode
Licensed under the MIT License (full text below).

Adaptations:
- E3/E4 (packages/engine/src/checkpoints.ts): file-checkpoint mechanism adapted from
  OpenCode's snapshot module — a shadow git repository (separate GIT_DIR under the keywork
  data dir, work tree at the project root) captured via `git add -A` + `git write-tree` and
  restored via `git read-tree --reset -u`, so the user's own git state is never touched.
- E1 (packages/shared/src/trust/permissions.ts): declarative tool-permission model
  adapted from OpenCode's permission config — allow/ask/deny actions per tool plus
  glob-pattern rules over the bash command string, with keywork's own
  most-specific-match precedence and chaining-character containment.
- D5/D6 (packages/engine/src/extensions/markdown-commands.ts, markdown-agents.ts):
  markdown command format (description/agent/model frontmatter + $ARGUMENTS,
  !`cmd` shell interpolation, @file embedding template semantics) and markdown
  agent format (frontmatter-configured agents with tool/permission restriction and
  a system-prompt body) adapted from OpenCode's conventions — no code copied;
  frontmatter expressed as flat lists to fit keywork's parser.

