OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw)
Copyright (c) 2026 OpenClaw Foundation
Licensed under the MIT License (full text below).

Adaptations:
- J3 (packages/engine/src/memory/store.ts): vault layout and lifecycle adapted from
  OpenClaw's documented memory design — MEMORY.md as the budgeted bootstrap index,
  append-only daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md episodic logs, markdown files as the canonical
  record with any index treated as disposable cache, and whole-file (never truncated)
  budget selection. Reimplemented in TypeScript from the documented design.

